{"product_id":"by-any-means-his-brand-new-adventure-from-wicklow-to-wollongong","title":"By Any Means: His Brand New Adventure from Wicklow to Wollongong","description":"\u003cp\u003eCharley Boorman has arranged himself a new challenge: he must travel from his home town in England all the way to Sydney, Australia, and he must use any means available to reach his destination, including steam train, horse, boat, kayak, motorcycle, and tuk-tuk. Whether crossing the Black Sea, trekking through Tibet, riding an elephant in India, or hiking through the forests of Papua New Guinea, this thrilling travelogue follows Charley's travels through extraordinary places via unusual transports. With trademark enthusiasm, dedication, and good humor, Charley tackles his most challenging voyage to date with astounding results. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:152 x 241  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Charley Boorman \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781847442475 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 352\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44373470216345,"sku":"15RE-4-9781847442475","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/e1c776795f22a5062c112082e583aec1.jpg?v=1716455419","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/by-any-means-his-brand-new-adventure-from-wicklow-to-wollongong","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}